
load @term/seed/code/lang
  find code-beam
  find code-beam-body

mint beam, like code-beam
  case name
    site name
  case body, mint beam-body
    site body
  hook make
    make code-beam
      bind name, read name
      bind body, read body

mint beam-body, like code-beam-body
  case node
    site node
  hook make
    make code-beam-body
      bind node, read node
